      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ON THE STRIP (2) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (20.37) at Angle Park. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Rates on top in this line up. COOL IT MISS (5) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when third (20.68) in a Other at Angle Park. Well placed here and should do much better. ANTECEDENT (8) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 20.23 beating Let's Go Pies. Leading player again. TAILORED MCLAREN (4) raced handy last time and scored. Must be respected.",
